{"id":"6695:310331","name":"字体 / 完善版","texts":[{"id":"6695:310336","text":"字体 / Typography","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310344","text":"字号 (pt)","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310345","text":"20","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310346","text":"14","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310347","text":"13","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310348","text":"16","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310349","text":"18","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310350","text":"12","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310351","text":"10","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310352","text":"字重","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310353","text":"Regular/Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310354","text":"Regular/Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310355","text":"Regular/Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310356","text":"Regular/Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310357","text":"Regular","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310358","text":"Regular","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310359","text":"Regular","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310360","text":"行间距","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310361","text":"1.5倍（24px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310362","text":"1.5倍（28px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310363","text":"1.5倍（20px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310364","text":"1.5倍（18px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310365","text":"1.5倍（16px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310366","text":"1.5倍（20px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310367","text":"常规指标数据，三级指标","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310368","text":"卡片标题","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310369","text":"页面标题","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310370","text":"常用字号，如正文/商品名称","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310371","text":"用于多数辅助信息类文字","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310372","text":"非常用字号，如标签","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310373","text":"用于多数次级文字","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310374","text":"使用场景","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310375","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310376","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310377","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310379","text":"1.5倍（30px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310381","text":"40","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310382","text":"24","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310383","text":"Regular/Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310384","text":"Regular/Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310385","text":"1.5倍（60px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310386","text":"1.5倍（36px）","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310387","text":"重要主指标数据，一级指标","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310388","text":"次要指标数据，二级指标","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310389","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310390","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310392","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310393","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310394","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310395","text":"字体","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310396","text":"文字样式","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310397","text":"字体类型","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310400","text":"字号及行高","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310404","text":"DIN 数字字体——仅一级指标/重要数据使用","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310405","text":"除默认字体外，在特殊或重要数据场景使用字体：DIN","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310409","text":"行间距：从一行文字的底部到另一行文字顶部的间距","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310410","text":"行距(行高) = 字号 + 行间距","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310411","text":"计算公式 = 字号*1.5（奇数+1）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310412","text":"例如：字号20px，行距/行高为30px","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310413","text":"Regular","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310414","text":"Bold","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310415","text":"Medium","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310416","text":"0","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310417","text":"1","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310418","text":"2","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310419","text":"3","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310420","text":"4","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310421","text":"5","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310422","text":"6","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310423","text":"7","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310424","text":"8","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310425","text":"9","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310427","text":"0","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310428","text":"1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310429","text":"2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310430","text":"3","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310431","text":"4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310432","text":"5","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310433","text":"6","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310434","text":"7","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310435","text":"8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310436","text":"9","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310438","text":"0","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310439","text":"1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310440","text":"2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310441","text":"3","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310442","text":"4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310443","text":"5","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310444","text":"6","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310445","text":"7","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310446","text":"8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310447","text":"9","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310449","text":"Aa","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310451","text":"Aa","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310452","text":"字","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310454","text":"字","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310462","text":"Android 系统 ","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310463","text":"中文字体 Source Han Sans、系统默认字体 ","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310465","text":"中文字体PingFang SC 苹方-简（Light、Regular、Medium）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310468","text":"iOS 系统 ","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310471","text":"字体 / Typography","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310472","text":"文字层级、图表专用样式与小屏适配分开定义。参数为Figma逻辑设计单位，不写成物理pt；字号、行高、字重分别记录。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310473","text":"2026.10.21 · 项目明文 / 样本实测 / 补充建议分开标记","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310475","text":"01 / 字体家族与使用范围","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310477","text":"项目主字体 · PingFang SC","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310478","text":"图表主样本采用Regular、Medium、Semibold。正文、标签、图表数字按各自样式选择；原系统字体板中的Light不能自动成为所有图表小字的默认字重。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310480","text":"数字字体例外 · DIN","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310481","text":"排名摘要实测DIN Bold 24/24，排名序号另有DIN Bold 14/19、16/24。DIN并非只用于一级指标；不强制全项目数字统一改成DIN。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310483","text":"Android与本板替代 · 按平台核对","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310484","text":"原字体板给出Source Han Sans/系统默认作为Android方向，尚无逐机型字体与字重映射。本板演示使用可用的Noto Sans SC；不把替代字体写成项目原始字体。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310486","text":"02 / 通用文字阶梯","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310487","text":"沿原目标字号阶梯整理的候选方案，明确适用场景；项目专用样式优先。通用行高以参数表为准，不再把1.5倍写成所有文字的强制算法。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310489","text":"用途","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310490","text":"字号 / 行高 / 字重","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310491","text":"显示示例（替代字体）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310492","text":"依据与适用边界","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310494","text":"一级主指标","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310495","text":"40 / 60 · Bold","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310497","text":"8726.40","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310498","text":"原目标阶梯候选；用于重要主值，不覆盖图表中心专用28/32。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310500","text":"二级指标","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310501","text":"24 / 36 · Medium","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310503","text":"2386.40","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310504","text":"原目标阶梯候选；非排名DIN 24/24的替代。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310506","text":"页面标题","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310507","text":"20 / 30 · Medium","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310509","text":"经营收入看板","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310510","text":"本板整理建议，使用场景沿目标文字层级；具体导航依页面样本。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310512","text":"模块标题","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310513","text":"18 / 28 · Medium","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310515","text":"区域累计收入","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310516","text":"本板整理建议；长标题允许换行，不挤压金额。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310518","text":"卡片标题","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310519","text":"16 / 24 · Medium","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310521","text":"收费率排名","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310522","text":"项目有16/24实测；不要求所有卡标题都16。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310524","text":"正文与Tab","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310525","text":"14 / 22 · Regular / Medium","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310527","text":"明细分析 / 趋势分析","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310528","text":"项目实测14/22；选中Tab Medium，未选Regular。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310530","text":"次级说明","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310531","text":"13 / 20 · Regular","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310533","text":"数据截至2026年8月30日","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310534","text":"原目标阶梯保留为候选；不作为已有图表刻度标准。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310536","text":"通用辅助文字","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310537","text":"12 / 18 · Regular","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310539","text":"更新时间与补充说明","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310540","text":"原目标通用阶梯候选；图表刻度专用12/20优先。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310542","text":"紧凑标签","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310543","text":"10 / 16 · Regular","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310545","text":"辅助标签","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310546","text":"原目标候选，仅限辅助用途；项目小同环比另有10/12。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310548","text":"03 / 图表专用文字（项目实测）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310549","text":"规格列记录原项目字体与参数；示例列使用Noto Sans SC。Semibold暂以Medium演示，排名混排示例不代表DIN的字形还原。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310551","text":"用途","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310552","text":"字号 / 行高 / 字重","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310553","text":"显示示例（替代字体）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310554","text":"依据与适用边界","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310556","text":"单环中心数值","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310557","text":"28 / 32 · Semibold","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310559","text":"96.20","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310560","text":"PingFang SC；来源4424:84468。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310562","text":"单环百分号","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310563","text":"14 / 26 · Medium","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310565","text":"%","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310566","text":"独立字号与行高；不将百分号与主值等大。来源4424:84468。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310568","text":"详情刻度 / 图例","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310569","text":"12 / 20 · Regular","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310571","text":"实收金额  20万","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310572","text":"PingFang SC；来源4424:74601。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310574","text":"紧凑同环比","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310575","text":"10 / 12 · Regular","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310577","text":"同 3.23%","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310578","text":"历史小字样本；不推广为手机正文可读性下限。来源4424:84468。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310580","text":"利润完成率","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310581","text":"32 / 40 · Semibold","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310583","text":"56.4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310584","text":"专用完成率样式；%另为14/28。来源4424:81027。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310586","text":"预存主金额","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310587","text":"22 / 32 · Semibold","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310589","text":"994.6","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310590","text":"单位“亿”另有14/29及14/26变体，不能全局统一。来源4424:84732。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310592","text":"排名主名次","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310593","text":"24 / 24 · DIN Bold","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310595","text":"52 /77","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310596","text":"实际“52”为DIN 24/24，“/77”为PingFang SC Semibold 14/22；本行仅示意混排关系。来源4424:84494。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310598","text":"表格 / 指标明细","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310599","text":"14 / 22 · Regular / Semibold","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310601","text":"应收金额 679.00万","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310602","text":"标签Regular、重要数值可Semibold，按真实混排处理。来源4424:84468、4424:84494。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310604","text":"04 / 行高、混排与移动适配","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310606","text":"行高不是行间距","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310607","text":"行高指每行文本占用的总高度；行间距不是同一个参数。原“字号×1.5（奇数+1）”改作通用候选的近似说明，不当计算所有样式的强制公式。14/22、12/20、28/32、32/40等项目专用值优先。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310609","text":"数值、单位与混排","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310610","text":"主值、单位、百分号与比较值分层。金额+万元，数值+%，名次52/77应分别设置样式并保持视觉对齐；行盒高度与基线需实际检查，不靠固定上移像素套全部字体。除排名混排等已实测部分外，对齐策略为补充建议。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310612","text":"文字颜色与状态","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310613","text":"主值/强调#22262F，正文#444F60，弱说明#9199A2，选中#00B2B2。颜色不可取代文字语义；同比方向色、风险灯色、选中态分开定义，不能统一为“绿好红坏”。色值为项目角色样本。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310615","text":"小屏、放大与长文字（建议）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310616","text":"标题与解释优先换行，数值优先单位进位和布局重组；不把整页等比缩小。关键金额、负号、小数点、%、单位不能被截断；系统字体放大后重新检查卡高、Tab和图表标签。具体断点与缩放倍率尚未定义。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310618","text":"字体回退与交付边界","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310619","text":"生产环境应核对实际可用字体、字重、中文与数字覆盖。当前工具没有PingFang SC与DIN；本板示例以Noto Sans SC显示，Semibold示例临时用Medium演示。样式参数如实保留，替代演示不算原字体视觉还原。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310621","text":"后续仍需确定","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310622","text":"Android默认字体/字重映射、系统字号放大的重排阈值、表格数字等宽支持、语言切换与字形替代仍待验证。本次完善说明板，不新建或覆盖全局文本样式，不将候选阶梯直接发布为Token。","visible":true}]}
